(* Every file the v1.x installer shipped under app\, payload\ and installer\:
   the union of `git ls-tree` over tags v1.0.0..v1.7.0 of the v1 source
   (10.PRODUCT/12.PRODUCTION). The legacy sweep deletes ONLY these paths.
   app\__init__.py, app\secrets_store.py and app\credential_lock.py are
   left out: this build ships them. app\assets\ is left out: the v1
   Start-menu and Startup shortcuts still take their icon from it.
   Generated by the colleague lane's gen_v1_list.py; 266 paths. *)

